vowpal_wabbit
------------------------------------------
This is a project started at Yahoo! Research and continuing at Microsoft
Research to design a fast, scalable, useful learning algorithm.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfmt12-12.2.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  python312-vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-1bl1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  eigen3-3.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  help2man-1.49.3-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libflatbuffers-devel-25.12.19-1bl2
  libfmt-devel-12.2.0-1bl1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libspdlog-devel-1.17.0-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  python312-pybind11-3.1.0-1
  rapidjson-devel-1.1.0p577-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/VowpalWabbit/vowpal_wabbit/archive/refs/tags/9.11.9.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-vowpal_wabbit-9.11.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

